{
  "name": "AI 智慧客服對話視窗 WebAPI",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🤖 範例 5：AI 智慧客服對話視窗 WebAPI\n\n1. **Webhook 接收**：接收前端 Widget 傳來的 `sessionId` 與 `message`。\n2. **AI Agent 推理**：串接語言模型與對話記憶（以 sessionId 隔離不同訪客歷史）。\n3. **即時回傳解答**：Respond to Webhook 即時將 AI 繁體中文回覆傳回前端對話框。",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 500
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        100
      ],
      "id": "ai-widget-note",
      "name": "流程說明"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "ai-chat-api",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {
          "allowedOrigins": "*"
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -180,
        380
      ],
      "id": "webhook-ai-chat-post",
      "name": "接收前端 AI 對話請求 (POST)",
      "webhookId": "ai-chat-api-endpoint"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.body.message || '您好' }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "你是一位親切、專業的極客數位官方網站 AI 智慧顧問。請一律使用繁體中文（台灣習慣用語）回答使用者。若使用者詢問自動化或 AI 串接服務，請熱情介紹 n8n、LINE、Telegram、Supabase 與 GAS 的整合優勢。"
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        100,
        380
      ],
      "id": "ai-chat-agent",
      "name": "網站 AI 客服代理"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.3
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -60,
        620
      ],
      "id": "ai-chat-model",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "YOUR_OPENAI_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "OpenAI account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sessionKey": "={{ $('接收前端 AI 對話請求 (POST)').item.json.body.sessionId || 'default_session' }}"
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.memoryBufferWindow",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        120,
        620
      ],
      "id": "ai-chat-memory",
      "name": "Window Buffer Memory"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"reply\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.output) }},\n  \"sessionId\": \"{{ $('接收前端 AI 對話請求 (POST)').item.json.body.sessionId }}\"\n}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 200,
          "responseHeaders": {
            "entries": [
              {
                "name": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "name": "Access-Control-Allow-Origin",
                "value": "*"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        380,
        380
      ],
      "id": "respond-ai-chat-reply",
      "name": "即時回傳 AI 回答給前端"
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "接收前端 AI 對話請求 (POST)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "網站 AI 客服代理",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "網站 AI 客服代理": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "即時回傳 AI 回答給前端",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "OpenAI Chat Model": {
      "ai_languageModel": [
        [
          {
            "node": "網站 AI 客服代理",
            "type": "ai_languageModel",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Window Buffer Memory": {
      "ai_memory": [
        [
          {
            "node": "網站 AI 客服代理",
            "type": "ai_memory",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "pinData": {}
}
